.TH CLAMPI 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
clampi \- Integer clamp of v to lo..hi
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqmathx.h\(dq
.BI "int clampi(int v, int lo, int hi);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Integer clamp of v to lo..hi.
.PP
This is a static inline function; it is defined in the header.
.SH RETURN VALUE
lo if v < lo, hi if v > hi, else v.
.SH MODULE
math (src/engine/math/mathx.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR clampf (3),
.BR gge\-api (7),
.BR gge (1)
